  "_doc": "The T2T consortium's T2T-CHM13 FASTAs (s3://human-pangenomics/T2T/CHM13/assemblies; github.com/marbl/CHM13) and the copies others publish. v2.0 is the 24 nuclear chromosomes (chrY from HG002) and CHM13's own mitochondrion (CP068254.1), named chr*: the consortium's chm13v2.0.fa.gz, UCSC hs1, iGenomes UCSC/CHM13. chm13v2.0_noY is v1.1 (per marbl/CHM13), as is chm13.draft_v1.1; chm13.draft_v1.0 is v1.0, whose report gives no UCSC names (chr + its GRC name). maskedY: chrY's PARs as N (layer_par_y); _rCRS: rCRS in place of CHM13's mitochondrion, named chrM. Broad's t2t/v2 files are maskedY and maskedY_rCRS with EBV (chrEBV), checked by their .dict.",
